@startuml
title EventFlow - Use Case Diagram (Academic)
skinparam shadowing false
left to right direction

actor "Anonymous Visitor" as AV
actor "Attendee" as AT
actor "Event Organizer" as OR
actor "Administrator" as AD
actor System as SY <<Supporting System>>
actor "LM Studio AI Assistant" as AI <<External System>>

AT -up-|> AV
AD -up-|> OR

usecase "UC01\nBrowse & explore public events" as UC01
usecase "UC02\nView event details & registration info" as UC02
usecase "UC03\nRegister for a public event" as UC03
usecase "UC04\nRegister for a private event (invite code)" as UC04
usecase "UC05\nGenerate invitation links (single / bulk)" as UC05
usecase "UC06\nCheck in with code / QR" as UC06
usecase "UC07\nSubmit evaluation & rating" as UC07
usecase "UC08\nView my registrations & cancel" as UC08
usecase "UC09\nView ticket & QR code" as UC09
usecase "UC10\nManage event (create / publish / archive / delete)" as UC10
usecase "UC11\nManage registrations & waitlist (promote)" as UC11
usecase "UC12\nManage attendees & attendance" as UC12
usecase "UC13\nManage venues / categories / sessions / speakers" as UC13
usecase "UC14\nSend notifications & announcements" as UC14
usecase "UC15\nChat in channels / private conversations" as UC15
usecase "UC16\nChat with the AI assistant about events" as UC16
usecase "UC17\nConfigure app settings & email templates" as UC17
usecase "UC18\nManage users, roles & suspension" as UC18
usecase "UC19\nSet manage-all-events flag" as UC19
usecase "UC20\nView dashboards & reports" as UC20
usecase "UC21\nUpload & manage event files" as UC21
usecase "UC22\nLogin & manage device sessions" as UC22
usecase "UC23\nRegister account & manage profile" as UC23
usecase "UC24\nReset password" as UC24
usecase "UC25\nGenerate QR ticket (on confirmation)" as UQR

AV --> UC01
AV --> UC02

AT --> UC03
AT --> UC04
AT --> UC06
AT --> UC07
AT --> UC08
AT --> UC09
AT --> UC15
AT --> UC16
AT --> UC22
AT --> UC23

UC03 ..> UQR : <<include>>\nissued on confirmation
UC04 ..> UQR : <<include>>\nissued on confirmation

OR --> UC05
OR --> UC10
OR --> UC11
OR --> UC12
OR --> UC13
OR --> UC14
OR --> UC15
OR --> UC20
OR --> UC21
OR --> UC22
OR --> UC23

AD --> UC10
AD --> UC11
AD --> UC17
AD --> UC18
AD --> UC19
AD --> UC20

SY ..> UC11 : waitlist promotion trigger
SY ..> UC14 : in-app / email delivery
SY ..> UC20 : aggregates statistics
SY ..> UC22 : JWT + device session
SY ..> UC24 : revokes all sessions
SY ..> UQR : QR generation

AI ..> UC16 : answers via event tools
UC16 ..> "Event data query (tools)" : <<include>>
AI -> "Event data query (tools)" : function calls

note right of UC04
  Invite-code validation:
  code must exist, be unused,
  match the event and attendee email.
  The link is marked used only after a
  successful registration.
end note
note bottom of UC03
  No "pending" registration state:
  available seat -> confirmed
  capacity full -> waitlisted.
end note
note right of UC19
  Administrator role can manage any
  event (manage-all-events), plus all
  registrations, attendees and reports.
end note
@enduml